## Prerequisites

Ensure you have the following installed on your machine:

- **Ruby**: `3.3.3`  
  Install Ruby using [rbenv](https://github.com/rbenv/rbenv) or [rvm](https://rvm.io/):

  ```bash
  rbenv install 3.3.3
  rbenv global 3.3.3
  ```

- **Rails**: `8.0.1`  
  Install Rails using:

  ```bash
  gem install rails -v 8.0.1
  ```
